{"id":"vod_sn_39116","vodId":"39116","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"圣魔之血","name_cn":"圣魔之血","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/7dbb4889c8b6b4216174e0ed7d43b017.jpg"},"summary":"《圣魔之血》原著名《Trinity Blood》，是日本作家吉田直在《The Sneaker》杂志连载之巴洛克风奇幻小说，内容环绕在“大灾难”造成文明毁灭的遥远未来。　　故事的舞台在未来的欧洲大陆。混乱的世界，神和魔鬼是世界的两个极端，他们相距人类很近，两者却有着天差地别的能力。圣堂的新神父亚伯·奈特罗德（Able Nightrord），看似一幅迷糊的表情，却有着不为人知的一面。只因他是身在神殿却流着恶魔之血的异种新人——吸食吸血鬼之血的吸血鬼。一方面他的存在受人类排挤，另一方面圣殿的人为了对抗遍布世界的各种恐怖生物又要借助他的力量。在和名为艾丝缇·布兰雪（Esther Blanchett）的少女相遇之后，两个人的命运都发生了极大的改变。在这种无法理清的矛盾中故事拉开了序幕……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r5PGMyAy6s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LWXzaFtXLG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/11EwTKWpwH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FZ2hYHSiKX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m06g4TJw4d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LXJzYh398n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WCUPdCG7751/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wzCQQ7Z2Ja1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xkDm9rNBg81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V9E7fW5KuU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WPGh1awrKf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jLJwEe2J8P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kLTHK02eYL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/